<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan forces have bombed an ELN camp near the Colombia border, killing at least 19, and a drone strike destroyed an ELN drug depot in the same area, causing at least 20 deaths. Opposition leader María Corina Machado returned to Venezuela and called for elections in her first address since returning. President Trump referenced the Maduro capture operation while discussing Cuba, suggested possible U.S. action against Cuba, and claimed Venezuelan oil revenues far exceed Iran war costs. Chevron is expanding operations in Venezuela while Exxon urges caution. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2007.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOTUd1NkxybFVCdHc0SzBacVctWkt0X0FjZ0VRcGFZMTA2Z1hQaEVIMVVFVjRXdjI0NzlpOUhqVHkxTmxxRG5fc1d1Tm9fZTZKSVF2enVhdGd3enBsU2pkZVgwNGh5VUVJYVJCUVByRnAwYi1qd0x5X1I1MGJtT3RILTVpcnBFbVJXbjFxSnFTU1poTEFRbE9veG1mVVRSQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNUlhUTFVwdmhJQk4tOGdDTlpGNzZqZV9sUFZDcE1hRUlDNjVIQjhXeEpENGM4dWdmdEh1QjRPdVZIbHk1bkIzSnVBSlVwREdKbG9lSlhXd1VZdGNSR2RiSF8weW1XU29rWW5rVXJiblNxSzdhV2g4VmpkY2ZEd3hCR19rTXl2UERQUFpIVXBoTFdTcHFyV1gwV0VLWEtLcGxIWV9r?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsBytes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNcW5ORE5zSVRESTVheFdXZ0E5VE9VdzNENDBBMFJMWnFiWmlMeWx0bWMzRlBTSUY3LWJjZ3VmZzBCaXNzTzcyQ2d3aFlDVnM1UEpwZkV0SThpMGlkbGtja1ZFWFlPNElIMFZfNUY3Y2x3VGhGcDZJYXhHVE5yUnA0M09URnRYMmRLdVVxeWJSMnZzcE5WSFN1WTN6MG9tUEJYTU12N0NTdVNIRlpvc1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Orinoco Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFBydkViYkZFVWl6RnhHZWhkd21qUTE0czY5eDN2QTF5TU0yYmVuSFhmeUVEWDhUZ25lWHlDbVViY2J2U0pZTmpxTTI1SjE4bHFZV2doVHpQQVg?oc=5&quot;&gt;